msgid ""
"**Description**: Map protein identifiers to STRING (Search Tool for "
"Retrieval of Interacting Genes/Proteins) database IDs. Essential first "
"step before using other STRING tools - converts your protein names (gene "
"symbols, UniProt IDs, Ensembl IDs) to STRING's internal identifiers. "
"STRING database contains 14M+ proteins from 5,000+ organisms with "
"functional association networks. No API key required (public API with "
"rate limits). Use for: preparing protein lists for network analysis, "
"converting between identifier types, validating protein names exist in "
"STRING, batch identifier conversion."
